# THE LIGHT HARNESS — the seal that never warps.
# Law reused verbatim from LIGHT---lIFEds6-7 (Lynn's chariots) and from the
# ASOLARIA-UNIVERSE-SIMULATOR, which already documented this exact failure:
#   "core.autocrlf=true on Windows silently rewrote FABLE5-SEE-SELF-64.hbp from
#    1142 B to 1155 B - one CRLF per row on a 13-row receipt - which broke its
#    own sha256 sidecar."
# That is precisely what happened to this repo on 2026-10-08: no .gitattributes,
# so every text receipt checked out CRLF and stopped reproducing its own digest.
# GIMEL is blob == working == sidecar. Anything else is SHIN.
#
# Default: touch nothing.
* -text
# Receipts, laws and sidecars are canonical LF on every seat.
*.md      text eol=lf
*.hbp     text eol=lf
*.hbi     text eol=lf
*.txt     text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.sha256  text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
# Binaries are binary and are never touched.
*.png   -text binary
*.gguf  -text binary
*.bin   -text binary
*.wasm  -text binary
